{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Creep out with this cozy fish collecting and decorating game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your own arcane aquarium in this cozy collection/idler game. Use your magic to summon juvenile cute creepy fish. Tend to them and watch them grow.\u00a0Make discoveries, expand your collection, decorate with art and plants.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of fish, plants, and decorative items to reveal and collect.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magically summon skelly seaponies, zombie blobfish, eyesquids and many more!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your monster fish as they grow and give you rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources from your fish and plants to unlock new summoning spells.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate your tanks with creepy cute decor.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect 200+ unique fish to fill your spell book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make a cozy space perfect for your creepy ichthyology collection!\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725320?t=1761574886","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725320?t=1761574886","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725320/ad157ba53c9f8a89efdb3591e4cc9837d6c37ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761574886","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725320/ad157ba53c9f8a89efdb3591e4cc9837d6c37ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761574886","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":